      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sheehy Meares Real Estate is delighted to present this well-proportioned three-bedroom bungalow, situated in the popular rural setting of Four Mile House, Co. Roscommon. Offering comfortable single-storey living in a peaceful location, this property represents an excellent opportunity for families, first-time buyers, or those seeking a spacious home with room to grow.\nA large well maintained site makes it an ideal family home. \n\nThe property is in super condition and ready for immediate occupation. \n\nAccommodation comprises a welcoming living room, a fitted kitchen, a utility room, three good-sized bedrooms, and a family bathroom.\n\nSet in the sought-after townland of Four Mile House, the property benefits from a quiet countryside setting while remaining within easy reach of Roscommon town and surrounding amenities, schools, and road networks.\n\nA particular feature of this property is the presence of additional out buildings , offering excellent potential for conversion to a home office, study, or additional living accommodation, subject to planning permission ? an attractive option for those working from home or requiring extra space for a growing family.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the accommodation and potential this home has to offer.\n\nContact Sheehy Meares Real Estate today to arrange a viewing.\n"
      },
